'''Lake Psyduck''' is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in [[Sinnoh]] featured in ''[[DP087|The Psyduck Stops Here!]]''. It is located between [[Solaceon Town]] and [[Celestic Town]].

The [[lake]] appears to be shaped like a {{p|Psyduck}}'s foot. It is surrounded by many kinds of {{Berries}}.

Several Psyduck retreated from the lake after a group of {{p|Muk}} took over, resulting in them blocking a road so that three Psyduck {{pkmn|Egg}}s could hatch without disturbance. {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} helped in driving the Muk away so that the Psyduck could live by the lake and stop blocking the road. The Muk were sent flying and landed in a nearby lake, which was polluted and home to other Muk.

